// Pictures. A room or a thing with a plate composes `Illustrated` and
// restates `:picture` with its own file and `:caption` with the words a
// client that cannot draw reads instead. A room shows its plate from the
// room's shared describe (room.sprout); a thing shows its plate on examine,
// from its own describe, since a thing's describe is its own. The default
// below is only there because a property must have one: every composer
// restates it, and `sprout pack` sends every file the world writes here.
extension media 1

kind Illustrated {
  :picture media.Image default "pictures/white-house.png"
  :caption string default "a picture"
}
